meta {
  name: Get product
  type: http
  seq: 2
}

get {
  url: {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/products/1
  body: none
  auth: none
}

docs {
  # Get one product

  Returns one active product by id.

  ## Auth

  None. Public. An optional Bearer token of an `ADMIN` also returns a **draft** product (`published: false`); without one — or with a non-admin, invalid or expired token, which is treated as no token rather than a 401 — a draft answers 404.

  ## Path parameters

  | Name | Type | Required | Notes |
  | --- | --- | --- | --- |
  | `id` | integer | yes | Positive integer. |

  ## Responses

  ### 200 OK

    {
      "message": "Product found",
      "data": {
        "id": 1,
        "categoryId": 4,
        "name": "Beach Towel",
        "code": "beach-towel",
        "price": 24.95,
        "stock": 40,
        "img": [
          "https://picsum.photos/seed/lpa-beach-towel/640/640"
        ],
        "description": "Quick-dry towel for Gold Coast beaches.",
        "published": true,
        "category": {
          "id": 4,
          "name": "Sports",
          "code": "sports"
        },
        "created": {
          "client": "2026-09-27T02:30:14.000Z",
          "server": "2026-09-27T02:30:14.000Z",
          "serverDate": "2026-09-27",
          "serverTime": "12:30:14",
          "unixTime": 1790476214,
          "user": 1,
          "role": "ADMIN"
        },
        "updated": null,
        "statusName": "ACTIVE",
        "status": 1,
        "createdAt": "2026-09-27T02:30:14.000Z",
        "updatedAt": "2026-09-27T02:30:14.000Z"
      },
      "pagination": null
    }

  ### 400 Bad Request — validation failed

  `id` is not a positive integer.

    {
      "message": "Some fields need attention.",
      "data": null,
      "pagination": null,
      "errors": [
        {
          "field": "id",
          "message": "Invalid input"
        }
      ]
    }

  ### 404 Not Found — no active product with this id

  Soft-deleted records answer 404 too, and so does a draft unless the caller sends an `ADMIN` token.

    {
      "message": "Product not found.",
      "data": null,
      "pagination": null,
      "errors": []
    }

  Outside production, error bodies also carry `stack`.
}
